    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611360/extras/385cd8cf3bf2f9bcc35b57d60d34a2d9.avif?t=1752053457\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">iTop Screen Recorder for Steam</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">iTop Screen Recorder for steam is a free and easy-to-use PC screen recorder. With no dropped frames and high FPS, it helps you effortlessly capture high-definition and professional-quality videos. In addition, it comes equipped with a suite of new, useful tools. This makes it perfect for recording fast-paced games.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">High-quality &amp; Lag-free Recording</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611360/extras/0421e92eaec084477a2c0f9deb5227e9.avif?t=1752053457\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0Capture any part of your screen easily and quickly, even the\u00a0iPhone/Android screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0Record YouTube videos, movies, live streaming and tutorial videos in 4K resolution</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Support record screen with audio and webcam at the same time. Both internal and external</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">webcam and microphone are supported</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Record your gaming highlight moment with no lags and\u00a0fps drop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Easy Video Editing Software for Everyone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611360/extras/1ad9d8c5aff1d8925338625529926872.avif?t=1752053457\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0Import and edit multiple video &amp; audio tracks in one shot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0Add transitions, effects, filters to make better storytelling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0Eliminate any noise in your gaming recording videos and audios</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Export 1080p videos to any platform. Share your creativity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">More Useful Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0Take high-quality screenshots while gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0Turn text into lifelike speech with 50+ Al voices across multiple languages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0Remove or replace background from image with the Al-powered BG remover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Make blurry images and videos clear in 1-click with AI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Reduce the file size of videos/recordings to 30%, 50% without compromising quality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">To See Clearly the Differences Between Free and PRO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611360/extras/70d91da512995dc21c5910aac2f79951.avif?t=1752053457\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611360/extras/385cd8cf3bf2f9bcc35b57d60d34a2d9.avif?t=1752053457\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">iTop Screen Recorder for Steam</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">iTop Screen Recorder for steam is a free and easy-to-use PC screen recorder. With no dropped frames and high FPS, it helps you effortlessly capture high-definition and professional-quality videos. In addition, it comes equipped with a suite of new, useful tools. This makes it perfect for recording fast-paced games.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">High-quality &amp; Lag-free Recording</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611360/extras/0421e92eaec084477a2c0f9deb5227e9.avif?t=1752053457\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0Capture any part of your screen easily and quickly, even the\u00a0iPhone/Android screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0Record YouTube videos, movies, live streaming and tutorial videos in 4K resolution</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Support record screen with audio and webcam at the same time. Both internal and external</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">webcam and microphone are supported</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Record your gaming highlight moment with no lags and\u00a0fps drop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Easy Video Editing Software for Everyone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611360/extras/1ad9d8c5aff1d8925338625529926872.avif?t=1752053457\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0Import and edit multiple video &amp; audio tracks in one shot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0Add transitions, effects, filters to make better storytelling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0Eliminate any noise in your gaming recording videos and audios</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Export 1080p videos to any platform. Share your creativity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">More Useful Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0Take high-quality screenshots while gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0Turn text into lifelike speech with 50+ Al voices across multiple languages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0Remove or replace background from image with the Al-powered BG remover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Make blurry images and videos clear in 1-click with AI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Reduce the file size of videos/recordings to 30%, 50% without compromising quality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">To See Clearly the Differences Between Free and PRO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611360/extras/70d91da512995dc21c5910aac2f79951.avif?t=1752053457\" /></div></p>",
